  "label": "Self-Reliance Philosophy",
  "description": "The meme is grounded in the philosophical concept of self-reliance, which emphasizes individual responsibility and the belief that one must earn their own success through personal effort. This philosophy is often associated with American ideals of independence and rugged individualism. The image of the man standing confidently next to his labor (hay bales) visually embodies this philosophy, making the text's message more impactful.",
